WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.697
This slide focuses on Nested dictionaries Start with
the meaning of the idea then

00:00:05.724 --> 00:00:11.574
connect it to the example and the larger analytical
workflow A dictionary

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:18.129
can contain another dictionary This is useful when
one record has sections Use

00:00:18.155 --> 00:00:23.668
nested dictionaries for organized records Access
nested values one key at

00:00:23.695 --> 00:00:29.385
a time Before running the example predict what the
output should look

00:00:29.412 --> 00:00:35.112
like Run it in the browser inspect the result then
change one input key value

00:00:35.322 --> 00:00:41.712
or condition and run it again Focus on what changed
and why Keep

00:00:41.725 --> 00:00:43.725
structure readable and consistent
